silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_06_sections_03_concrete_anchor_4#loratrainingsignal silm:hasLongDescription "The LoraTrainingSignal is the corpus rendered as LoRA training data. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'LoRA training signal', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
